{"id":"zurzeit","lemma":"zurzeit","pos":"adv","rank":2591,"glosses":["currently"],"ipa":"/tsʊrˈtsaɪt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/58/De-zurzeit.ogg/De-zurzeit.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er arbeitet zurzeit nicht viel.","en":"He's not working much at the moment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2014","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to work","l":"arbeiten"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"much, a lot"}]},{"text":"Zurzeit ist niemand im Büro.","en":"No one is in the office at the moment.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"office"}]},{"text":"Zurzeit schlafen sie alle.","en":"Right now they're all sleeping.","words":[null,{"g":"to sleep"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"all, everyone"}]},{"text":"Ich bin zurzeit sehr beschäftigt.","en":"These days I'm very busy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"very"},{"g":"busy (engaged in an…"}]},{"text":"Zurzeit geht es mir nicht übel.","en":"I'm not doing too badly at the moment.","words":[null,{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"bad, evil, terrible"}]}]}